OL,3,GNEWSASouthampton International Boat
OL,4,AShow gets under way
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 10-day celebration of everything from
OL,7,Fmulti-million-pound superyachts to
OL,8,Fpaddleboards is under way as the 57th
OL,9,FSouthampton International Boat Show
OL,10,Fopens its doors.
OL,12,FThousands of visitors are expected to
OL,13,Fattend the event, which runs until 27
OL,14,FSeptember at the city's Mayflower Park
OL,15,Fand marina.
OL,17,FOrganisers say the show features
OL,18,FEurope's largest purpose-built show
OL,19,Fmarina, with more than 500 boats and
OL,20,Fwatercraft on display and opportunities
OL,21,Ffor visitors to step aboard selected
OL,22,Fvessels.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
